{"Company Name":"Isio Wealth Planning Limited","Created At":"2025-05-06T03:14:49.494Z","Employee Count":1099,"Enrich Company.country":"GB","Enrich Company.description":"Driven by our purpose to create better outcomes for our clients, our people and society, we deliver fresh thinking and innovative solutions bespoke for pensions trustees, employers, individuals, families and their offices. 

We are an industry-leading challenger, providing diverse expertise across pensions, employee benefits, investment and wealth, giving clients an integrated experience. Providing a unique mix of trustee and corporate clients we are grounded around a vision which strives to deliver greater financial confidence for everyone.

Our heritage gives us a unique edge. Decades of experience combined with the independence we enjoy today, enables us to be agile and invest quickly in innovative new solutions that bring better outcomes for our clients and society.","Enrich Company.domain":"isio.com","Enrich Company.employee_count":1099,"Enrich Company.follower_count":17561,"Enrich Company.founded":2020,"Enrich Company.industry":"Financial Services","Enrich Company.last_refresh":"2025-04-18T21:32:15.275901","Enrich Company.locality":"London","Enrich Company.logo_url":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/media.mixrank.com/hero-img/1dea94a74424c782bdcbd1d86989695f","Enrich Company.name":"Isio","Enrich Company.org_id":37858234,"Enrich Company.size":"1,001-5,000 employees","Enrich Company.slug":"isiogroup","Enrich Company.type":"Privately Held","Enrich Company.url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/isiogroup","Enrich Company.website":"http://www.isio.com","Follower Count":17561,"Name":"Isio","Total Advisers":23,"Website":"https://www.isio.com/premierwealthplanning.com","Website (2)":"http://www.isio.com"}

{"Company Name":"CG Wealth Planning Limited","Created At":"2025-05-06T03:14:49.494Z","Employee Count":941,"Enrich Company.country":"US","Enrich Company.description":"Canaccord Genuity is the global capital markets division of Canaccord Genuity Group Inc., offering institutional and corporate clients idea-driven investment banking, merger and acquisition, research, sales and trading services from offices in North America, UK & Europe, Asia, and Australia. Our diverse team of capital markets and advisory professionals has deep industry and transactional expertise in key growth sectors of the global economy. We are committed to providing valued services to our clients throughout the entire lifecycle of their business and operating as a gold standard independent investment bank – expansive in resources and reach, but targeted in industry expertise, market focus and individual client attention.

#DrivenByYourSuccess

 2025 Canaccord Genuity Group Inc.","Enrich Company.domain":"cgf.com","Enrich Company.employee_count":941,"Enrich Company.follower_count":36752,"Enrich Company.founded":null,"Enrich Company.industry":"Financial Services","Enrich Company.last_refresh":"2025-04-02T02:41:28.170962","Enrich Company.locality":"New York, NY","Enrich Company.logo_url":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/media.mixrank.com/hero-img/528047af20efdbd7526d32a43d551f6e","Enrich Company.name":"Canaccord Genuity - Global Capital Markets","Enrich Company.org_id":978774,"Enrich Company.size":"501-1,000 employees","Enrich Company.slug":"canaccord-genuity-global-capital-markets","Enrich Company.type":"Public Company","Enrich Company.url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/canaccord-genuity-global-capital-markets","Enrich Company.website":"http://www.cgf.com","Follower Count":36752,"Name":"Canaccord Genuity - Global Capital Markets","Total Advisers":53,"Website":"https://www.canaccordgenuity.com/wealth-management","Website (2)":"http://www.cgf.com"}

{"Company Name":"True Bearing Ltd","Created At":"2025-05-06T03:14:49.494Z","Employee Count":544,"Enrich Company.country":"GB","Enrich Company.description":"Amber River comprises a group of like-minded, values-driven people with a passion for financial planning. We help to guide thousands of people around the UK through life's major milestones, working hard to enrich their lives and the communities they live in.

The people behind Amber River fall into three main groups. There's the Board, a group of trusted and respected individuals with a long and successful track record in financial and investment services. Then there's the central team, working flexibly from home and in our London and Henley offices. And there are our IFAs. The people who live, breathe and sleep financial planning. They all run successful businesses in their respective regions, coming together under the Amber River umbrella.

Together, we help to carve the financial contours of our clients' lives. We call this Life Landscaping.","Enrich Company.domain":"amberriver.com","Enrich Company.employee_count":544,"Enrich Company.follower_count":1168,"Enrich Company.founded":null,"Enrich Company.industry":"Financial Services","Enrich Company.last_refresh":"2025-04-04T11:10:45.738344","Enrich Company.locality":"London, England","Enrich Company.logo_url":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/media.mixrank.com/hero-img/97e788d1230171fd21b51272687fbcf7","Enrich Company.name":"Amber River","Enrich Company.org_id":77058687,"Enrich Company.size":"201-500 employees","Enrich Company.slug":"amber-river","Enrich Company.type":"Privately Held","Enrich Company.url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/amber-river","Enrich Company.website":"https://www.amberriver.com","Follower Count":1168,"Name":"Amber River","Total Advisers":27,"Website":"https://www.amberriver.com/true-bearing","Website (2)":"https://www.amberriver.com"}

