{"Company Name":"Tees Financial Limited","Created At":"2025-05-06T03:14:49.396Z","Employee Count":454,"Enrich Company.country":"GB","Enrich Company.description":"Tees is a Top 200 UK law firm providing expert legal services and independent financial advice. We work for individuals and businesses, professional partnerships, charities, national corporations and institutions.

Established in 1913, Tees has grown from a traditional family firm with strong agricultural roots, into a dynamic regional full-service practice, with six offices in the East of England.

We have many senior advisers with years of experience who are always on hand to advise on your case and they work closely with younger lawyers to share their knowledge. Our award-winning trainee scheme is a testament to the depth of quality you’ll find at Tees - quality for you as a client or if you want to build your career with us.","Enrich Company.domain":"teeslaw.com","Enrich Company.employee_count":454,"Enrich Company.follower_count":5769,"Enrich Company.founded":1913,"Enrich Company.industry":"Law Practice","Enrich Company.last_refresh":"2025-04-15T16:41:25.93704","Enrich Company.locality":"Bishop's Stortford, Hertfordshire","Enrich Company.logo_url":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/media.mixrank.com/hero-img/d9558a726253681e751b29e0a01e5c5a","Enrich Company.name":"Tees","Enrich Company.org_id":636457,"Enrich Company.size":"201-500 employees","Enrich Company.slug":"stanley-tee-llp","Enrich Company.type":"Partnership","Enrich Company.url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/stanley-tee-llp","Enrich Company.website":"http://www.teeslaw.com","Follower Count":5769,"Name":"Tees","Total Advisers":18,"Website":"https://www.teeslaw.com","Website (2)":"http://www.teeslaw.com"}

