{"Company Name":"Marshall Zoing Limited","Created At":"2025-05-06T03:14:48.325Z","Employee Count":302,"Enrich Company.country":"GB","Enrich Company.description":"WEALTH at work is a leading financial wellbeing and retirement specialist - helping those in the workplace to improve their financial future. 

Established in 2005, our financial coaches work with hundreds of organisations across both the private and public sector by providing financial education and one to one guidance. This can be arranged on a bespoke basis and covers a full range of topics.

For those wishing to understand their personal financial situation, support is also provided through our helpline. At this point, we can provide access to a savings platform or provide regulated financial advice. Our advice service supports those who need specific recommendations which is particularly useful for those at retirement.","Enrich Company.domain":"wealthatwork.co.uk","Enrich Company.employee_count":302,"Enrich Company.follower_count":3204,"Enrich Company.founded":2005,"Enrich Company.industry":"Financial Services","Enrich Company.last_refresh":"2025-04-23T08:11:27.516774","Enrich Company.locality":"Liverpool, Merseyside","Enrich Company.logo_url":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/media.mixrank.com/hero-img/70aadc86f7144dec53507700cf12c1a5","Enrich Company.name":"WEALTH at work","Enrich Company.org_id":2105999,"Enrich Company.size":"201-500 employees","Enrich Company.slug":"wealth-at-work","Enrich Company.type":"Privately Held","Enrich Company.url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/wealth-at-work","Enrich Company.website":"http://www.wealthatwork.co.uk","Follower Count":3204,"Name":"WEALTH at work","Total Advisers":5,"Website":"https://www.wealthatwork.co.uk","Website (2)":"http://www.wealthatwork.co.uk"}

{"Company Name":"SPF Private Clients Limited","Created At":"2025-05-06T03:14:49.186Z","Employee Count":253,"Enrich Company.country":"GB","Enrich Company.description":"SPF Private Clients (SPF) is an award winning financial services intermediary established in London in 1997. With offices across the UK and Channel Islands we offer mortgage advice, wealth management and insurance broking. Whether you are buying your first flat, investing in a holiday home, insuring your valuable possessions or planning your retirement, we can make it happen.

Experts in funding for high value property and complex circumstances we have access to a wide range of funding options as well as preferential rates and bespoke arrangements. Over the past 25 years we have built strong relationships with the high street lenders and private banks, giving us access to the key decision makers. 

We operate on a fee charging basis with our mortgage and wealth management clients, which we are able to justify on the basis of our ability to offer a combination of excellent products, high levels of service and access to the real decision makers. We pride ourselves on providing an all round professional and personal service.","Enrich Company.domain":"spf.co.uk","Enrich Company.employee_count":253,"Enrich Company.follower_count":7228,"Enrich Company.founded":1997,"Enrich Company.industry":"Financial Services","Enrich Company.last_refresh":"2025-04-06T17:39:56.073196","Enrich Company.locality":"London","Enrich Company.logo_url":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/media.mixrank.com/hero-img/16476b6bd7908135c8f84eb6ad141777","Enrich Company.name":"SPF Private Clients","Enrich Company.org_id":60626,"Enrich Company.size":"201-500 employees","Enrich Company.slug":"spf-private-clients","Enrich Company.type":"Privately Held","Enrich Company.url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/spf-private-clients","Enrich Company.website":"http://www.spf.co.uk","Follower Count":7228,"Name":"SPF Private Clients","Total Advisers":9,"Website":"https://www.spf.co.uk","Website (2)":"http://www.spf.co.uk"}

{"Company Name":"Financial Lifestyle Management Ltd","Created At":"2025-05-06T03:14:49.494Z","Employee Count":235,"Enrich Company.country":"GB","Enrich Company.description":"Our mission is to always put our client’s goals at the centre of everything we do. We listen to our clients, deliver a comprehensive financial strategy and then ensure that plan remains relevant and up to date over time. We know that financial success is best achieved through precise and sustained focus, which is why our teams work very closely to create the best possible outcome. There are three approaches in which we can provide financial focus. Financial Focus For You, Financial Focus For Your Talent & Financial Focus For Your Business. 

For career opportunities have a look at our careers page on our website for live job updates.

FLM is an Appointed Representative of and represents only St. James’s Place Wealth Management plc (which is authorised and regulated by the Financial Conduct Authority) for the purpose of advising solely on the Group’s wealth management products and services, more details of which are set out on the Group’s website www.sjp.co.uk/products. The title ‘Partner Practice’ is the marketing term used to describe St. James’s Place representatives. FLM is a trading name of Financial Lifestyle Management Ltd, which is registered in England & Wales No. 04426632. Registered Office: 37 Warren Street, London, England, W1T 6AD","Enrich Company.domain":"flmltd.com","Enrich Company.employee_count":235,"Enrich Company.follower_count":2736,"Enrich Company.founded":1999,"Enrich Company.industry":"Financial Services","Enrich Company.last_refresh":"2025-04-06T20:54:13.722777","Enrich Company.locality":"London","Enrich Company.logo_url":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/media.mixrank.com/hero-img/07614ff6f4af5da438f0d34fe6280735","Enrich Company.name":"FLM","Enrich Company.org_id":1147941,"Enrich Company.size":"51-200 employees","Enrich Company.slug":"flm-wealth-management","Enrich Company.type":"Privately Held","Enrich Company.url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/flm-wealth-management","Enrich Company.website":"http://www.flmltd.com","Follower Count":2736,"Name":"FLM","Total Advisers":38,"Website":"https://www.flmltd.com","Website (2)":"http://www.flmltd.com"}

{"Company Name":"KW Wealth Planning Limited","Created At":"2025-05-06T03:14:49.494Z","Employee Count":233,"Enrich Company.country":"GB","Enrich Company.description":"At Kingswood we believe everyone should have access to financial advice and be able to Protect and Grow their wealth. We put our clients at the forefront of our business, providing financial advice, managing investments, and combining wealth planning with investment management. Kingswood brings all your wealth management services all in one place and we are with you every step of the way.

We are an integrated wealth management business offering a comprehensive range of financial planning and investment services. Our goal is to build enduring relationships to realise the best financial outcomes for our clients and their families. 

We provide a full suite of wealth management services. Your first conversation with one of our advisers is free without any obligation to you. Start the conversation with us by visiting our website.","Enrich Company.domain":"kingswood-group.com","Enrich Company.employee_count":233,"Enrich Company.follower_count":10769,"Enrich Company.founded":2010,"Enrich Company.industry":"Financial Services","Enrich Company.last_refresh":"2025-04-14T05:27:35.835988","Enrich Company.locality":"London","Enrich Company.logo_url":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/media.mixrank.com/hero-img/d605b36605551e923d7634de24b47d01","Enrich Company.name":"Kingswood Group","Enrich Company.org_id":4998538,"Enrich Company.size":"201-500 employees","Enrich Company.slug":"kingswood-1","Enrich Company.type":"Public Company","Enrich Company.url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/kingswood-1","Enrich Company.website":"http://www.kingswood-group.com/contact","Follower Count":10769,"Name":"Kingswood Group","Total Advisers":78,"Website":"https://www.kingswood-group.com","Website (2)":"http://www.kingswood-group.com/contact"}

{"Company Name":"WREN STERLING FINANCIAL PLANNING LIMITED","Created At":"2025-05-06T03:14:49.786Z","Employee Count":226,"Enrich Company.country":"GB","Enrich Company.description":"Wren Sterling is a nationwide independent financial planning business with multiple offices across the UK. 

