{"Company Name":"HUB Financial Solutions Limited","Created At":"2025-05-06T03:14:49.008Z","Employee Count":181,"Enrich Company.country":"GB","Enrich Company.description":"At HUB Financial Solutions, our purpose is to help people achieve a better later life. We’re totally focused on finding the right financial solutions for people approaching, or in, retirement. We don’t do anything else. 

We provide advice on releasing equity from people’s homes, turning pension savings into income for retirement and funding long-term care - comparing the best products from across the whole market. HUB Financial Solutions is part of Just Group plc – a FTSE-250 company and a specialist in the retirement market. 

Just Group plc includes Just Retirement Limited which is one of the UK’s leading providers of retirement products and Just Retirement Money Limited, a provider of lifetime mortgages.","Enrich Company.domain":"hubfinancialsolutions.co.uk","Enrich Company.employee_count":181,"Enrich Company.follower_count":1232,"Enrich Company.founded":null,"Enrich Company.industry":"Financial Services","Enrich Company.last_refresh":"2025-04-14T13:01:22.210426","Enrich Company.locality":"Belfast, Northern Ireland","Enrich Company.logo_url":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/media.mixrank.com/hero-img/47f8a7828904c64258ad23ec1d784bbe","Enrich Company.name":"HUB Financial Solutions (a HUB Group company)","Enrich Company.org_id":19838157,"Enrich Company.size":"201-500 employees","Enrich Company.slug":"hub-financial-solutions-limited","Enrich Company.type":"Public Company","Enrich Company.url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/hub-financial-solutions-limited","Enrich Company.website":"https://www.hubfinancialsolutions.co.uk/","Follower Count":1232,"Name":"HUB Financial Solutions (a HUB Group company)","Total Advisers":8,"Website":"https://www.hubfinancialsolutions.co.uk","Website (2)":"https://www.hubfinancialsolutions.co.uk/"}

