{"Company Name":"Bartlett Wealth Management Ltd","Created At":"2025-05-06T03:14:48.904Z","Employee Count":166,"Enrich Company.country":"GB","Enrich Company.description":"Established in 1940, Bartlett Group is an independent insurance and financial solutions specialist, offering tailored services for businesses and individuals. From bespoke insurance solutions to employee benefit packages, wealth management, and independent financial advice, our comprehensive offerings reflect our commitment to excellence. Honoured with accolades such as the UK Broker of the Year and Commercial Lines Broker of the Year in 2020, and ranked in the Financial Times Top 100 UK Financial Advisers, Bartlett Group operates globally, reaching clients in over 30 countries through our UK and overseas offices and an extensive network of associates. As a Chartered Insurance Broker, our dedication to quality is evident in our client-centric approach and the expertise of our in-house team. 

Today, managed proudly by the third generation of Bartletts, Bartlett Group serves businesses, charities, and individuals across the UK, ranging from regional manufacturing firms to large financial institutions. Private clients include families we've had the privilege of assisting for generations. Looking forward to the next decade rather than the next quarter, we are well-positioned to continue creating meaningful and enjoyable careers for our colleagues nationwide. When you join Bartlett, you contribute to supporting vulnerable young people in the UK and abroad. We allocate 8% of our profits to grassroots organisations, raising over a million pounds in the last four years alone for remarkable causes.

Navigating markets effectively and securing success, we invite you to discover more about Bartlett's standard-setting services at www.bartlettgroup.com.","Enrich Company.domain":"bartlettgroup.com","Enrich Company.employee_count":166,"Enrich Company.follower_count":4453,"Enrich Company.founded":1940,"Enrich Company.industry":"Financial Services","Enrich Company.last_refresh":"2025-04-14T05:25:47.20102","Enrich Company.locality":"Leeds, West Yorkshire","Enrich Company.logo_url":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/media.mixrank.com/hero-img/506ab81f0c8d3f9ac21bc94bb9270e1d","Enrich Company.name":"Bartlett Group","Enrich Company.org_id":537965,"Enrich Company.size":"51-200 employees","Enrich Company.slug":"bartlett-group-ltd","Enrich Company.type":"Privately Held","Enrich Company.url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/bartlett-group-ltd","Enrich Company.website":"http://www.bartlettgroup.com","Follower Count":4453,"Name":"Bartlett Group","Total Advisers":8,"Website":"https://www.bartlettgroup.com/product/wealth-manag","Website (2)":"http://www.bartlettgroup.com"}

column10:
Origen Financial Services is one of the UK’s leading financial advisers. We will help clients to: 
•	simplify their financial life and help achieve their financial goals
•	generate an income from their portfolio now and in retirement
•	build a legacy for their loved ones.   
We provide advice to individuals, small to medium sized businesses and employees of some of the UK’s largest organisations. 
Our role as financial advisers is to fully understand financial aims and ambitions and to create a financial plan to help our clients to reach their financial goals. We believe in building long term client relationships. 
We pride ourselves on putting our clients first. We guide clients through the financial maze, build their financial knowledge and help them make confident and informed financial decisions at the right time. 
Contact us:
Telephone: 0344 209 3925*
Email: clientservices@origenfs.co.uk 
*Calls are charged at your phone company’s basic rate. All calls are recorded for business purposes.
Our services 
Through our team of highly qualified advisers across the UK, we provide advice on: 
- Workplace and personal pensions and investments; 
- Protection, including critical illness, life insurance and income protection; 
- Pre-retirement planning, including tax planning;    
- At retirement planning, including advice on annuities and drawdown; 
- Estate planning including Inheritance Tax and Trusts
For business clients, we offer: 
- Advice services to pension scheme members for Pension Liability Management projects  
- Auto-enrolment advice, including restructuring existing employee benefit programmes; 
- Benchmarking and review of workplace benefit packages against employees’ needs and industry peers; 
- Advice on workplace pension schemes, group risk, healthcare and employee wellbeing;  
– Content for staff communications on pensions and reward statements, branded employee materials, onsite seminars, and 1-2-1 advice sessions; 
- Financial education services for emp

