{"Company Name":"NOVA Wealth Ltd","Created At":"2025-05-06T03:14:49.295Z","Employee Count":85,"Enrich Company.country":"GB","Enrich Company.description":"We take the uncertainty out of your finances – with straight-talking advice to help you do more with your money.

Maybe you’ve started to think about your retirement. It could be you’re wondering how to juggle your family’s needs and your own. Or perhaps you just want the reassurance that your money’s working as hard as it can. Whatever the goal, we’ll build you an expert plan to get you there. Because some things are too important to DIY.

Getting help shouldn’t be a hassle, so we’ll pair you with an adviser in minutes. You can chat to them online, on the phone, or face-to-face. And we’ll do it all without an ounce of jargon. It’s smart, faff-free financial advice – on your terms.","Enrich Company.domain":"novawm.com","Enrich Company.employee_count":85,"Enrich Company.follower_count":3943,"Enrich Company.founded":2018,"Enrich Company.industry":"Financial Services","Enrich Company.last_refresh":"2025-04-06T13:15:41.18891","Enrich Company.locality":"London, England","Enrich Company.logo_url":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/media.mixrank.com/hero-img/bc0a07ef3737f5f8945db3fbb3d1bbc6","Enrich Company.name":"NOVA","Enrich Company.org_id":18935178,"Enrich Company.size":"11-50 employees","Enrich Company.slug":"nova-wealth-uk","Enrich Company.type":"Privately Held","Enrich Company.url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/nova-wealth-uk","Enrich Company.website":"https://novawm.com","Follower Count":3943,"Name":"NOVA","Total Advisers":12,"Website":"https://novawm.com","Website (2)":"https://novawm.com"}

