{"Company Name":"BBT Group Limited","Created At":"2025-05-06T03:14:49.494Z","Employee Count":50,"Enrich Company.country":"GB","Enrich Company.description":"BBT Group Ltd. is a firm of Chartered Financial Planners specialising in retirement planning. With decades of industry experience, our aim is simple - to deliver high-quality, holistic financial advice that helps our clients to achieve their goals.

Operating nationally, our team of 20+ independent financial planners are dedicated to meeting the needs of our 5,000+ clients with in excess of £700 million under management.

We recognise that making major financial decisions can feel overwhelming, particularly those that will have an impact on the rest of your life. This is why we work with you, offering guidance and advice that you can trust.","Enrich Company.domain":"bbtgroup.co.uk","Enrich Company.employee_count":50,"Enrich Company.follower_count":316,"Enrich Company.founded":1998,"Enrich Company.industry":"Financial Services","Enrich Company.last_refresh":"2025-04-12T10:34:59.435025","Enrich Company.locality":"WAKEFIELD","Enrich Company.logo_url":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/media.mixrank.com/hero-img/fea5e25829200a5ef244f666fd2399d3","Enrich Company.name":"BBT Group Ltd","Enrich Company.org_id":19922996,"Enrich Company.size":"51-200 employees","Enrich Company.slug":"bbtgroup","Enrich Company.type":"Privately Held","Enrich Company.url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/bbtgroup","Enrich Company.website":"http://www.bbtgroup.co.uk","Follower Count":316,"Name":"BBT Group Ltd","Total Advisers":23,"Website":"https://www.bbtgroup.co.uk","Website (2)":"http://www.bbtgroup.co.uk"}

{"Company Name":"Legal & Medical Investments Ltd","Created At":"2025-05-06T03:14:49.494Z","Employee Count":49,"Enrich Company.country":"GB","Enrich Company.description":"At Legal & Medical, we specialise in providing tailored financial advice and investment planning solutions to clients in the medical and dental professions. 

