{"Company Name":"Alexander Beard Investment Management Limited","Created At":"2025-05-06T03:14:49.295Z","Employee Count":42,"Enrich Company.country":"GB","Enrich Company.description":"Alexander Beard are specialist International Financial Advisers. With offices around the world. We have the local knowledge and global expertise to advise domestic and globally mobile clients as well as those who emigrate to a new country. Clients work with us to build a personal financial plan and we guide them through the complexities of different national financial regimes. With internationally qualified and nationally regulated experts, our team will advise you on how to make the most of the financial opportunities being internationally mobile can offer.

Our international clients build financial assets and investments in several countries. We consider residential and domicile status to advise on how to accumulate and invest their funds. We advise on when, where and how to draw income to avoid paying more tax than is necessary. 

When approaching retirement clients use our knowledge to help them make decisions on how to consolidate their finances. Having international holdings makes this process more complex and our guidance is there to help clients avoid the pitfalls and capitalise on the opportunities.","Enrich Company.domain":"abg.net","Enrich Company.employee_count":42,"Enrich Company.follower_count":620,"Enrich Company.founded":1987,"Enrich Company.industry":"Financial Services","Enrich Company.last_refresh":"2025-04-06T21:29:33.385464","Enrich Company.locality":"Ellesmere Port, Cheshire","Enrich Company.logo_url":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/media.mixrank.com/hero-img/c5b0b80b441ecbc025ed7b89df8f32f3","Enrich Company.name":"Alexander Beard","Enrich Company.org_id":2721315,"Enrich Company.size":"51-200 employees","Enrich Company.slug":"alexander-beard-group","Enrich Company.type":"Privately Held","Enrich Company.url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/alexander-beard-group","Enrich Company.website":"http://www.abg.net","Follower Count":620,"Name":"Alexander Beard","Total Advisers":12,"Website":"https://www.abg.net","Website (2)":"http://www.abg.net"}

{"Company Name":"Alexander Beard Global Services Limited","Created At":"2025-05-06T03:14:49.295Z","Employee Count":42,"Enrich Company.country":"GB","Enrich Company.description":"Alexander Beard are specialist International Financial Advisers. With offices around the world. We have the local knowledge and global expertise to advise domestic and globally mobile clients as well as those who emigrate to a new country. Clients work with us to build a personal financial plan and we guide them through the complexities of different national financial regimes. With internationally qualified and nationally regulated experts, our team will advise you on how to make the most of the financial opportunities being internationally mobile can offer.

Our international clients build financial assets and investments in several countries. We consider residential and domicile status to advise on how to accumulate and invest their funds. We advise on when, where and how to draw income to avoid paying more tax than is necessary. 

When approaching retirement clients use our knowledge to help them make decisions on how to consolidate their finances. Having international holdings makes this process more complex and our guidance is there to help clients avoid the pitfalls and capitalise on the opportunities.","Enrich Company.domain":"abg.net","Enrich Company.employee_count":42,"Enrich Company.follower_count":620,"Enrich Company.founded":1987,"Enrich Company.industry":"Financial Services","Enrich Company.last_refresh":"2025-04-06T21:29:33.385464","Enrich Company.locality":"Ellesmere Port, Cheshire","Enrich Company.logo_url":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/media.mixrank.com/hero-img/c5b0b80b441ecbc025ed7b89df8f32f3","Enrich Company.name":"Alexander Beard","Enrich Company.org_id":2721315,"Enrich Company.size":"51-200 employees","Enrich Company.slug":"alexander-beard-group","Enrich Company.type":"Privately Held","Enrich Company.url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/alexander-beard-group","Enrich Company.website":"http://www.abg.net","Follower Count":620,"Name":"Alexander Beard","Total Advisers":12,"Website":"https://www.abg.net","Website (2)":"http://www.abg.net"}

{"Company Name":"Pennymatters Limited","Created At":"2025-05-06T03:14:49.494Z","Employee Count":41,"Enrich Company.country":"GB","Enrich Company.description":"We are an Independent Financial Planning practice of highly qualified and experienced individuals with extensive market knowledge. Whilst we pride ourselves in being a general practice, we have specialists in house to ensure our clients can receive the right advice from those best qualified.

Obtaining the right independent financial advice is paramount and we are confident that we have a team of advisers with the right tools to satisfy any clients' needs regarding Pensions, Investments, Protection or Mortgages. Our overall aim is to communicate our approach to any individual or company who has a desire to improve their financial situation, irrespective of their financial status.

The firm fully embraces the latest technology to maximise planning time for advisers and minimise client cost.","Enrich Company.domain":"pennymatters.co.uk","Enrich Company.employee_count":41,"Enrich Company.follower_count":228,"Enrich Company.founded":2011,"Enrich Company.industry":"Financial Services","Enrich Company.last_refresh":"2025-04-02T21:42:15.956876","Enrich Company.locality":"Bracknell, Berkshire","Enrich Company.logo_url":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/media.mixrank.com/hero-img/8d75521b8d3f7f8c21e3e04cb4910739","Enrich Company.name":"Pennymatters Limited","Enrich Company.org_id":4985205,"Enrich Company.size":"11-50 employees","Enrich Company.slug":"pennymatters-limited","Enrich Company.type":"Privately Held","Enrich Company.url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/pennymatters-limited","Enrich Company.website":"http://www.pennymatters.co.uk","Follower Count":228,"Name":"Pennymatters Limited","Total Advisers":22,"Website":"https://www.pennymatters.co.uk","Website (2)":"http://www.pennymatters.co.uk"}

{"Company Name":"Marshall Wooldridge Financial Services Ltd","Created At":"2025-05-06T03:14:49.295Z","Employee Count":37,"Enrich Company.country":"GB","Enrich Company.description":"Established in 1973, Marshall Wooldridge has grown into one of the top 50 regional independent brokers in the country. We have built an enviable reputation of technical competence across all classes of commercial and sports insurances.

We pride ourselves upon providing a customer focused, service proposition to all of our clients delivered by experienced, qualified insurance professionals. Our commitment to service and quality across the business has been recognised by the Chartered Insurance Institute having awarded us Chartered status. From small beginnings our business now spreads across 3 locations in Yeadon, close to Leeds and from 2014 an office based in Rotherham, South Yorkshire. We currently employ over 55 members of staff, placing premiums in excess of £22m annually. We advise on all aspects of insurance but are primarily commercial and industrial specialists where we aim to deliver tailored risk solutions.

As our business continues to evolve, a number of valuable and successful partnerships have been forged including with the English & Wales Cricket Board (ECB), and Deliciously Yorkshire who promote the interests of food and drink companies in Yorkshire and Humberside. We are extremely proud of our expertise in the sports, waste and food and drink sectors.","Enrich Company.domain":"marshallwooldridge.com","Enrich Company.employee_count":37,"Enrich Company.follower_count":910,"Enrich Company.founded":1973,"Enrich Company.industry":"Insurance","Enrich Company.last_refresh":"2025-04-22T12:17:05.274685","Enrich Company.locality":"Leeds, West Yorkshire","Enrich Company.logo_url":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/media.mixrank.com/hero-img/63b8eaed32fd1a202ce5881de93d8e04","Enrich Company.name":"Brown & Brown (Previously Marshall Wooldridge Insurance Brokers & Risk Managers)","Enrich Company.org_id":1052335,"Enrich Company.size":"51-200 employees","Enrich Company.slug":"marshallwooldridgecompany","Enrich Company.type":"Privately Held","Enrich Company.url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/marshallwooldridgecompany","Enrich Company.website":"http://www.marshallwooldridge.com","Follower Count":910,"Name":"Brown & Brown (Previously Marshall Wooldridge Insurance Brokers & Risk Managers)","Total Advisers":11,"Website":"https://www.marswool.com","Website (2)":"http://www.marshallwooldridge.com"}

