Our service brings together a comprehensive range of solutions to address the key areas of effective wealth planning, such as;

•	maintaining your lifestyle;
•	protecting you, the family estate & intergenerational planning;
•	business protection, profit extraction, succession planning and planning for 
         sale or exit;
•	supporting your personal, business and professional interests.

Our Advisers are fully supported by our inhouse Technical & Administrative teams and who all have the same founding ethos when it comes to outstanding client outcomes.

We pride ourselves on being innovative, nimble and thorough in our approach to all that we do. We work with many associated businesses, providing access to additional services such as foreign exchange through TorFX, concierge, specialist banking. Please note that these are referral services, as such the services provided are separate and distinct to those offered by St. James's Place.

