{"Company Name":"Verdant Financial Planning Limited","Created At":"2025-05-06T03:14:48.904Z","Employee Count":11,"Enrich Company.country":null,"Enrich Company.description":"Our company is built around our clients.  We won’t treat you as a number.  You are all individuals, so every piece of advice we give is bespoke to you.  With over 100 years of advisory experience between us, Verdant Financial Planning offer highly qualified independent advice, so you can rest assured you are in capable hands.
Maintaining our independence and having access to the whole of the market for our clients, is central to our core beliefs.  We are not tied to any one investment house or life office provider, allowing us to provide you with maximum choice and flexibility at any given time.  

We strive to be successful and want to share that success with the communities both we and our clients live in.  We aim to achieve this by helping local clubs and charities and to make a positive contribution to our planet.","Enrich Company.domain":"verdantfp.co.uk","Enrich Company.employee_count":11,"Enrich Company.follower_count":151,"Enrich Company.founded":2020,"Enrich Company.industry":"Financial Services","Enrich Company.last_refresh":"2025-04-20T23:51:45.883287","Enrich Company.locality":null,"Enrich Company.logo_url":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/media.mixrank.com/hero-img/76600d5cabe8a4528b392fe2ef4fcc2a","Enrich Company.name":"Verdant Financial Planning Ltd","Enrich Company.org_id":86951276,"Enrich Company.size":"11-50 employees","Enrich Company.slug":"verdant-financial-planning-ltd","Enrich Company.type":"Privately Held","Enrich Company.url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/verdant-financial-planning-ltd","Enrich Company.website":"https://www.verdantfp.co.uk/","Follower Count":151,"Name":"Verdant Financial Planning Ltd","Total Advisers":7,"Website":"https://www.verdantfp.co.uk","Website (2)":"https://www.verdantfp.co.uk/"}

