{"Company Name":"Heritage Independent Financial Consultancy Ltd","Created At":"2025-05-06T03:14:48.427Z","Employee Count":9,"Enrich Company.country":"GB","Enrich Company.description":"Planning for a comfortable financial future takes confidence, nothing more. Setting your goals is the first step to success. It gives focus and direction. That's where we can help. 

We ask the questions, look into your future, give straight-talking advice and find the right financial solution by: 

identifying your short, medium, and long-term goals;
clarifying precisely what you want from life;
mapping out your route to get there;
making easy-to-understand product recommendations;
adjusting your plan during significant life changes.
Being independent we will look after your personal interests. With access to the entire financial market, we can search thousands of options to find the most suitable products and services for you.

If you are thinking about creating and putting your financial plan into action, we may consider things you've not. Why not talk it through with us today?

Follow us on YouTube  https://www.youtube.com/@HeritageIFC","Enrich Company.domain":"heritage-ifc.com","Enrich Company.employee_count":9,"Enrich Company.follower_count":129,"Enrich Company.founded":2000,"Enrich Company.industry":"Financial Services","Enrich Company.last_refresh":"2025-04-19T11:53:49.716494","Enrich Company.locality":"Taunton, England","Enrich Company.logo_url":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/media.mixrank.com/hero-img/37e03e4fd44cb5255d3061faff73bcdc","Enrich Company.name":"Heritage Independent Financial Consultancy Ltd","Enrich Company.org_id":94180679,"Enrich Company.size":"2-10 employees","Enrich Company.slug":"heritage-ifc-ltd","Enrich Company.type":"Public Company","Enrich Company.url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/heritage-ifc-ltd","Enrich Company.website":"www.heritage-ifc.com","Follower Count":129,"Name":"Heritage Independent Financial Consultancy Ltd","Total Advisers":5,"Website":"https://www.heritage-ifc.com","Website (2)":"www.heritage-ifc.com"}

{"Company Name":"XL Independent Financial Advisers Ltd","Created At":"2025-05-06T03:14:48.904Z","Employee Count":8,"Enrich Company.country":"GB","Enrich Company.description":"We hope to offer you peace of mind from the worries of unexpected costs, reacting to market ups and downs and tax planning by providing a personal, professional service. We place our experience, expertise and good name at your disposal to help you plan for your financial future.

Your interests are at the heart of everything we do. We accompany you every step of the way on your journey towards greater financial security. We listen to your needs and to your own attitude towards investment so that we can help you create and execute a strategy tailored to meet your objectives within your preferred levels of risk.

Together we can make your money work harder for you, in the most tax efficient way.","Enrich Company.domain":"xlifa.co.uk","Enrich Company.employee_count":8,"Enrich Company.follower_count":33,"Enrich Company.founded":2003,"Enrich Company.industry":"Financial Services","Enrich Company.last_refresh":"2025-04-23T01:15:30.074982","Enrich Company.locality":"Ipswich, Suffolk","Enrich Company.logo_url":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/media.mixrank.com/hero-img/bf5d1364b1a2081ba468708e81d734d2","Enrich Company.name":"XL INDEPENDENT FINANCIAL ADVISERS LIMITED","Enrich Company.org_id":63979564,"Enrich Company.size":"11-50 employees","Enrich Company.slug":"xl-independent-financial-advisers-limited","Enrich Company.type":"Privately Held","Enrich Company.url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/xl-independent-financial-advisers-limited","Enrich Company.website":"https://xlifa.co.uk/","Follower Count":33,"Name":"XL INDEPENDENT FINANCIAL ADVISERS LIMITED","Total Advisers":7,"Website":"https://www.xlifa.co.uk","Website (2)":"https://xlifa.co.uk/"}

{"Company Name":"Advanced Asset Consultants Ltd","Created At":"2025-05-06T03:14:48.795Z","Employee Count":8,"Enrich Company.country":"GB","Enrich Company.description":"At Advanced Asset Consultants, we are a leading Chartered Financial Planning practice with a passion for putting our clients first. Based in Glasgow, we serve private investors, professional intermediaries, charities, and unions across Scotland with a focus on financial education.

Our expert team is dedicated to understanding your unique needs and requirements, and providing straightforward, jargon-free advice. We believe in using innovative and practical solutions to deliver cost-effective financial plans tailored specifically to you and your business.

As an independent practice, we have the freedom to act in your best interest, without being tied to any one insurance or investment group. Our highly-qualified consultants hold excellent credentials from the Chartered Insurance Institute and have a wealth of industry experience. All of our team members are dedicated to ongoing professional development and are on track to achieving chartered status, ensuring our clients receive the highest level of technical expertise, delivered in a simple and easy-to-understand manner.","Enrich Company.domain":"advancedasset.co.uk","Enrich Company.employee_count":8,"Enrich Company.follower_count":386,"Enrich Company.founded":2009,"Enrich Company.industry":"Financial Services","Enrich Company.last_refresh":"2025-04-14T03:13:02.762142","Enrich Company.locality":"Glasgow, City of Glasgow","Enrich Company.logo_url":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/media.mixrank.com/hero-img/5140641ba009e7a68d188aa7a3882644","Enrich Company.name":"Advanced Asset Consultants Ltd-Chartered Financial Planners","Enrich Company.org_id":5100723,"Enrich Company.size":"11-50 employees","Enrich Company.slug":"advanced-asset-consultants-ltd","Enrich Company.type":"Privately Held","Enrich Company.url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/advanced-asset-consultants-ltd","Enrich Company.website":"http://www.advancedasset.co.uk","Follower Count":386,"Name":"Advanced Asset Consultants Ltd-Chartered Financial Planners","Total Advisers":6,"Website":"https://www.advancedasset.co.uk","Website (2)":"http://www.advancedasset.co.uk"}

{"Company Name":"Sanderson Financial Ltd","Created At":"2025-05-06T03:14:48.325Z","Employee Count":8,"Enrich Company.country":"GB","Enrich Company.description":"Our team of financial advisers is made up of dedicated professionals with years of experience helping clients achieve their financial goals.

Our advisors are committed to building long-term relationships with our clients and providing personalized financial advice to meet their unique needs. Contact us today to learn more about our team and how we can help you achieve your financial goals.

Sanderson Financial Ltd is based out of 9 Twigworth Court Business Centre, United Kingdom.","Enrich Company.domain":"sandersonfinancial.co.uk","Enrich Company.employee_count":8,"Enrich Company.follower_count":124,"Enrich Company.founded":null,"Enrich Company.industry":"Financial Services","Enrich Company.last_refresh":"2025-04-02T23:07:59.801061","Enrich Company.locality":"Gloucester","Enrich Company.logo_url":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/media.mixrank.com/hero-img/ef83176a63322ece2b6f3a042723bdf6","Enrich Company.name":"Sanderson Financial Ltd","Enrich Company.org_id":4135931,"Enrich Company.size":"11-50 employees","Enrich Company.slug":"sanderson-financial-ltd","Enrich Company.type":"Privately Held","Enrich Company.url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/sanderson-financial-ltd","Enrich Company.website":"http://www.sandersonfinancial.co.uk/","Follower Count":124,"Name":"Sanderson Financial Ltd","Total Advisers":5,"Website":"https://www.sandersonfinancial.co.uk","Website (2)":"http://www.sandersonfinancial.co.uk/"}

{"Company Name":"Wealth Design Holdings Limited","Created At":"2025-05-06T03:14:48.795Z","Employee Count":7,"Enrich Company.country":"GB","Enrich Company.description":"Welcome to the Wealth Design Group, a team of independent financial advisers who take a fresh approach to making your wealth work for you. With our extensive geographic coverage which includes Hunter & Co based in Streetly and Wealth Design Ltd extending from Cannock through Staffordshire and into mid-Wales– our team come with a wealth of experience and a variety of backgrounds and expertise. That said, they all have one thing in common: a commitment to customer satisfaction, a job well done and a satisfactory outcome for happy clients.

Established in 2014, Wealth Design has already seen tremendous growth. More recently, by acquiring Hunter & Co to run alongside Wealth Design, we have gained a new level of experience by joining forces with a firm that has been operating since 1995. And now, the Wealth Design Group moves into a new era with a focus on growing our presence in Mid Wales.

It is an incredibly exciting time to be involved with Wealth Design and we've even got the accolades to prove it. We were runner up for Most Promising New Start-Up at the 2017 Staffordshire Business Awards and runner up for Young Business of the Year at the Express & Star Business Awards 2017. More importantly, we were outright winners for the Express & Star 2017 Micro Business of the Year.","Enrich Company.domain":"wealthdesign.co.uk","Enrich Company.employee_count":7,"Enrich Company.follower_count":68,"Enrich Company.founded":2014,"Enrich Company.industry":"Financial Services","Enrich Company.last_refresh":"2025-04-22T09:56:46.281823","Enrich Company.locality":"Cannock, Staffordshire","Enrich Company.logo_url":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/media.mixrank.com/hero-img/7e7a60fd673a22e1ae6fba2fb6dda31d","Enrich Company.name":"Wealth Design","Enrich Company.org_id":9259100,"Enrich Company.size":"11-50 employees","Enrich Company.slug":"wealth-design-ltd","Enrich Company.type":"Privately Held","Enrich Company.url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/wealth-design-ltd","Enrich Company.website":"http://www.wealthdesign.co.uk","Follower Count":68,"Name":"Wealth Design","Total Advisers":7,"Website":"https://www.wealthdesign.co.uk","Website (2)":"http://www.wealthdesign.co.uk"}

{"Company Name":"Simpson Kelly Associates Ltd","Created At":"2025-05-06T03:14:48.795Z","Employee Count":7,"Enrich Company.country":"GB","Enrich Company.description":"Established in 2011, the team at Simpson Kelly Associates has many years’ experience providing practical financial planning advice to people, families and businesses. With a team of 8 Financial Advisors based in their central office in Pontefract, they provide advice to clients throughout Yorkshire, Lincolnshire and the surrounding areas.

We provide advice across a wide range of services including investments, savings, pensions and protection. We are committed to putting clients at the heart of everything we do and to developing long-term relationships with our clients. This is achieved by ensuring that we understand the individual needs of each client, and to implementing tailored financial plans to address those needs.

At Simpson Kelly Associates, we pride ourselves on the friendly and approachable nature of our advisers and staff, and on playing an integral part of the local community.","Enrich Company.domain":"skassociates.co.uk","Enrich Company.employee_count":7,"Enrich Company.follower_count":27,"Enrich Company.founded":2011,"Enrich Company.industry":"Financial Services","Enrich Company.last_refresh":"2025-04-10T22:06:13.046211","Enrich Company.locality":"Pontefract, West Yorkshire","Enrich Company.logo_url":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/media.mixrank.com/hero-img/c3f8bfc45cf7f671149396279d10e62a","Enrich Company.name":"Simpson Kelly Associates Ltd","Enrich Company.org_id":28151144,"Enrich Company.size":"2-10 employees","Enrich Company.slug":"simpson-kelly-associates-ltd","Enrich Company.type":"Privately Held","Enrich Company.url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/simpson-kelly-associates-ltd","Enrich Company.website":"http://skassociates.co.uk","Follower Count":27,"Name":"Simpson Kelly Associates Ltd","Total Advisers":7,"Website":"https://skassociates.co.uk","Website (2)":"http://skassociates.co.uk"}

