{"Company Name":"Holyoakes Group Ltd","Created At":"2025-05-06T03:14:48.904Z","Employee Count":6,"Enrich Company.country":"GB","Enrich Company.description":"Holyoakes Group is proud of the fact we offer a genuinely personal service to all of our Advisers. We recognise that each Adviser and AR Firm is unique in the same way that our clients are and because of this we do not believe in the single suited approach. Our aim is to provide a bespoke approach which will enable us all to work in a cost controlled and efficient way.

Holyoakes Group was established in 2005 to provide a platform for Individual Advisers and Small Firms to operate under and therefore achieve their own business objectives. We are fully independent and Directly Regulated by the Financial Conduct Authority. We have an infrastructure specifically developed to provide business assistance on a tailored to the individual basis. We believe the key ingredient to success is the high ethical standards which are filtered throughout the whole of the business. This is because we have a passionate belief in the value of independent financial advice, delivered by professional and ethical individuals.

Holyoakes Group is committed to help your business flourish. The very essence of being a Financial Adviser is rooted in the independence where you and you alone make decisions, organise and prioritise your business and most importantly look after your clients. Holyoakes Group Ltd has the experience and the financial strength to deliver the best service and direction to all of our members and in turn allow them to run a successful and profitable business.","Enrich Company.domain":"holyoakes.co.uk","Enrich Company.employee_count":6,"Enrich Company.follower_count":209,"Enrich Company.founded":2005,"Enrich Company.industry":"Financial Services","Enrich Company.last_refresh":"2025-04-19T15:27:45.43863","Enrich Company.locality":"Bromsgrove, Worcestershire","Enrich Company.logo_url":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/media.mixrank.com/hero-img/c758fdbd24c0e7df8d08938d12324f83","Enrich Company.name":"Holyoakes Group Ltd","Enrich Company.org_id":2807868,"Enrich Company.size":"11-50 employees","Enrich Company.slug":"holyoakes-group-ltd","Enrich Company.type":"Privately Held","Enrich Company.url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/holyoakes-group-ltd","Enrich Company.website":"http://www.holyoakes.co.uk/index.html","Follower Count":209,"Name":"Holyoakes Group Ltd","Total Advisers":8,"Website":"https://www.holyoakes.co.uk","Website (2)":"http://www.holyoakes.co.uk/index.html"}

{"Company Name":"Scott Kerr","Created At":"2025-05-06T03:14:48.427Z","Employee Count":6,"Enrich Company.country":null,"Enrich Company.description":"We are a friendly & professional team committed to providing you with financial peace of mind and be happy! We will help you put together a detailed and bespoke financial plan, which will be reviewed regularly and will help you on your way to achieving your goals and ambitions in life. We specialise in pensions and investments and we offer a no-obligation review in these areas.

